    text: "Affected northbound trips:\r\n2:48 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n3:18 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n3:33 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n3:48 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n4:18 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n4:48 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n5:03 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n5:18 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n5:48 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n6:18 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n6:33 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n6:48 pm from 16th Street & California St Station to 30th & Downing Station\r\n\nAffected southbound trips:\r\n3:14 pm from 30th & Downing Station to 16th & Stout Station\r\n3:59 pm from 30th & Downing Station to 16th & Stout Station\r\n4:44 pm from 30th & Downing Station to 16th & Stout Station\r\n5:29 pm from 30th & Downing Station to 16th & Stout Station\r\n6:14 pm from 30th & Downing Station to 16th & Stout Station"
